<title>UK: AHB sets 500 million mark 10-year FRN.</title>
<headline>AHB sets 500 million mark 10-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    16.JAN.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     ZERO	PAY DATE    08.NOV.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.185   FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LISTING    FRANKFURT DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
